      "body": "## TemplateCat - 帮你叼来了 9873 个网页模板的小猫咪\n\n网站链接： https://www.templatecat.net/zh-cn\n\n### 这是什么？\n一只帮你挑选专业设计模板的小猫 🐱。开个玩笑！其实是\"按分类浏览模板\"(templates by categories)的意思。\n\n我在给客户做网页设计的时候（比如牙医网站），经常需要跨平台对比不同网站构建工具的模板。在各个平台之间来回跳转特别烦人，所以我做了这个工具。\n\n### 模板来源\n- Framer\n- Webflow\n- Squarespace\n\n（之后会加入 Figma Sites 和 Readymag，我猜未来会有 10k+ 模板）\n\n### 有什么功能？\n\n- 高质量模板 - 我只从那些雇佣专业设计师的网站构建工具中挑选\n- 按分类/功能/风格浏览 - 比如找「作品集」或「极简」风格的模板\n- 页面内预览 + 设备切换 - 直接查看桌面/平板/手机效果\n- 列出网站构建工具定价 - 方便比较成本\n（即将支持：价格区间筛选、合并相似标签）\n\n简单说就是：省去在不同平台之间来回跳转找模板的时间。\n\n希望对同样需要快速找模板的朋友有帮助！\n\n---\n\n## TemplateCat - A little cat that picks up 9873 professionally designed templates for you\n\n**Website:** https://www.templatecat.net/zh-cn\n\n### What is this?\n\nA little cat that helps you pick professionally designed templates 🐱. Just joking! It means \"templates by categories\".\n\nWhen doing web design for clients (eg. a dentist website), I often need to compare templates across different website builders. Jumping between platforms was really annoying, so I made this tool.\n\n### Where are the templates from \n\n- Framer\n- Webflow\n- Squarespace\n\n(Will add Figma Sites and Readymag later, I guess 10k+ templates in the future)\n\n### What are the features?\n- **High quality templates** - I only choose from website builder products where they hire professional designers.\n- **Browse by categories/features/styles** - eg. find \"portfolio\" or \"minimalist\" templates\n- **On-page preview + device switching** - directly see desktop/tablet/mobile effects\n- **Website builder pricing listed** - easy to compare costs\n- (Coming soon: pricing range filters, merge similar tags)\n\nSimply put: saves time jumping between different platforms to find templates.\n\nHope this helps friends who also need to quickly find templates!",
